<hi rendition="#smaller">des</hi><lb/>
Frauen-Stimmrechts und Proportional-Wahlsystems.</titlePart><lb/>
</docTitle> <byline>Von<lb/>
<persName ref="http://d-nb.info/gnd/118507893"><hi rendition="#g">August Bebel</hi></persName>.</byline><lb/>
<space dim="vertical"/>                     <milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
